  author = {Michele Altomare and Shir Sara Bekhor and Marco Sacchi and Federico Ambrogi and Gabriele Infante and Arturo Chieregato and Federico Pozzi and Tullia Maria De Feo and Lorenza Nava and Elisabetta Masturzo and Luca Del Prete and Carolina Perali and Elena Manzo and Paolo Bertoli and Francesco Virdis and Andrea Spota and Stefano Piero Bernardo Cioffi and Laura Benuzzi and Giuliano Santolamazza and Mauro Podda and Andrea Mingoli and Osvaldo Chiara and Stefania Cimbanassi},
